window.ScripturaLexicons.LSJ.rowsHtml+="<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n939\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρονόμος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον: frequentador do campo, de ninfas, feras e pastores; substantivo masculino, magistrado responsável pela administração dos distritos rurais, Platão e Aristóteles. Forma</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n940\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγροπόνος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino: lavrador, aquele que cultiva o solo; glossário.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n941\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρός</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino, genitivo -οῦ. I. Campo, terreno cultivado, propriedade rural, fazenda; frequentemente plural, terras, campos, em oposição a jardins ou pousios; Homero, Xenof</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n942\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγροτέκτων</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino: equivalente a ἔποψ, nome de ave, poupa; testemunho atribuído a Alexandre de Licópolis.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n943\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρότερος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo poético -α, -ον. I. Selvagem, do campo, especialmente de animais e plantas, Homero, Hesíodo. II. Campônio, de gente rural. III. Relativo à caça, que gosta de caçar, de nin</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n944\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγροτήρ</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino, genitivo -ῆρος: camponês, equivalente a ἀγρότης; feminino adjetival ἀγρότειρα, rústica; Eurípides.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n945\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρότης</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino poético. I. Camponês, habitante dos campos; Eurípides. II. Caçador, de pessoas, ninfas, Pã e Ártemis; feminino ἀγρότις; Homero, Álcman, Antologia Palatina.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n946\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγροῦαι</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Glosa plural ἀγροῦαι = ἀγροῖκοι, «camponeses, rústicos»; Hesíquio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n947\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγροφον</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Glosa ἄγροφον = ὀρεινόν, «montanhês, das montanhas»; Hipócrates em Galeno e Suda.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n948\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγροφύλαξ</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino: guarda rural, vigilante ou guardião do território campestre; epigramas e papiros.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n949\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγρυκτος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον, de ἀ- privativo e γρύζω: indizível, de que não se deve falar, de acontecimentos; Ferécrates 157.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n949a\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρυξία</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino: silêncio profundo, silêncio absoluto; Píndaro, fragmento 229. Suplemento LSJ.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n950\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρυπνέω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo. I. Permanecer acordado, passar a noite sem dormir, sofrer de insônia; Teógnis, Hipócrates, Platão. II. Figuradamente velar, vigiar, ficar alerta, inclusive sobre almas; Sabe</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n951\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρυπνητέον</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbal impessoal: deve-se velar ou manter vigilância; Eustácio 168.16.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n952\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρυπνητήρ</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino, genitivo -ῆρος: aquele que vigia, vigia noturno; Manílio 1.81.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n953\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρυπνητής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino: vigia, guardião (latim excubitor); glossário.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n954\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρυπνητικός</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ή, -όν. I. Vigilante, propenso a permanecer acordado; Diodoro, Plutarco. II. Que provoca insônia ou mantém desperto; Galeno, papiros mágicos. Neutro ἀγρυπνητικόν: feitiço</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n955\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρυπνία</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino, jônico -ίη. I. Insônia, ausência de sono ou estado de vigília; Hipócrates, Heródoto, Platão. II. Tempo passado vigiando, turno de vigília; Justiniano. III. Fi</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n956\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγρυπνος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον. I. Desperto, vigilante, que não dorme, de pessoas e metaforicamente de raio de Zeus ou litoral; τὸ ἄγρυπνον, vigilância. II. Ativo: que espanta o sono, que impede dor</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n957\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρυπνώδης</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ες: que causa insônia, que impede o sono; leitura variante em Hipócrates, Prorrético 1.10.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n958\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγρωμα</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo neutro, significado incerto: possivelmente direito de caça; inscrição de Gortina, Annuario 3.195.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n959\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγρωσσα</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino: caçadora, epíteto de uma cadela; Simônides 130.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n960\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρώσσω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo épico, equivalente a ἀγρεύω: capturar, apanhar, pescar; figuradamente sair à caça. Empregado sobretudo no presente; passivo em Opiano.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n961\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρώστης</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino. I. Camponês, do campo, como substantivo e adjetivo, tragédia e epigrama. II. Selvagem, de ave. III. Caçador, Apolônio de Rodes. IV. Nome de espécie de aranha</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n962\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρωστῖνος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Forma siracusana correspondente a ἄγροικος, título de peça de Epicarmo; plural ἀγρωστῖναι glosado como ninfas montanhesas em Hesíquio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>";
window.ScripturaLexicons.LSJ.cardsHtml+="<article id=\"entry-lsj-n939\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n939\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"951\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρονόμος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον: frequentador do campo, de ninfas, feras e pastores; substantivo masculino, magistrado responsável pela administração dos distritos \">ἀγρονόμος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον: frequentador do campo, de ninfas, feras e pastores; substantivo masculino, magistrado responsável pela administração dos distritos rurais, Platão e Aristóteles. Forma ἀγρόνομος: que oferece pastagem livre, de planícies, currais ou matas; Sófocles e Opiano.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)grono/mos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n939&quot; key=&quot;a)grono/mos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρο-νόμος&quot;&gt;ἀγρονόμος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;νέμομαι&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n939.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;haunting the country,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Νύμφαι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:6:106&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 6.106&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;θῆρες&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,005:142&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ag.&lt;/title&gt; 142&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; (lyr.), cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,031:2:49&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Vict.&lt;/title&gt; 2.49&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;βοτῆρες&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;title&gt;Epic. Oxy.&lt;/title&gt; 1015.7&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n939.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Subst.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀγρονόμος&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;νέμω&lt;/etym&gt;) a magistrate in charge of the country districts, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,034:760b&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lg.&lt;/title&gt; 760b&lt;/bibl&gt;, al., cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,035:1321b:30&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pol.&lt;/title&gt; 1321b30&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n939.2&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀγρόνομος&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;i&gt;affording open pasturage,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πλάκες, αὐλαί,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,004:1103&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;OT&lt;/title&gt; 1103&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,002:785&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Ant.&lt;/title&gt; 785&lt;/bibl&gt; (both lyr.); &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὕλη&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0023,001:1:27&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Opp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;H.&lt;/title&gt; 1.27&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n940\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n940\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"952\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγροπόνος\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino: lavrador, aquele que cultiva o solo; glossário.\">ἀγροπόνος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino: lavrador, aquele que cultiva o solo; glossário.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gropo/nos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n940&quot; key=&quot;a)gropo/nos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρο-πόνος&quot;&gt;ἀγροπόνος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n940.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;tiller of the soil,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;Gloss.&lt;/title&gt;&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n941\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n941\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"953\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρός\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino, genitivo -οῦ. I. Campo, terreno cultivado, propriedade rural, fazenda; frequentemente plural, terras, campos, em oposição \">ἀγρός</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino, genitivo -οῦ. I. Campo, terreno cultivado, propriedade rural, fazenda; frequentemente plural, terras, campos, em oposição a jardins ou pousios; Homero, Xenofonte. II. O campo enquanto zona rural, por oposição à cidade; morar, vir ou trabalhar no campo; produtos rurais. Provérbios com ἀγρός descrevem grosseria. Etimologia comparativa sânscrita sugerida como hipótese.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gro/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n941&quot; key=&quot;a)gro/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρός&quot;&gt;ἀγρός&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;οῦ&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n941.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;field,&lt;/i&gt; mostly in pl., &lt;i&gt;fields, lands,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:23:832&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 23.832&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:4:757&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 4.757&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,002:4:149&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;P.&lt;/title&gt; 4.149&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.; opp. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;κῆποι,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0566,002:2b:115&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Theopomp. Hist.&lt;/author&gt; 89&lt;/bibl&gt;; sg., &lt;i&gt;farm,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:24:205&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 24.205&lt;/bibl&gt;; also in pl., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,001:2:4:1&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;HG&lt;/title&gt; 2.4.1&lt;/bibl&gt;:—&lt;i&gt;tilled land,&lt;/i&gt; opp. fallow, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρὸς καὶ ἀργός, Ἀθηνᾶ&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;20.167&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; (&lt;placeName&gt;Erythrae&lt;/placeName&gt;). &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n941.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;country,&lt;/i&gt; opp. town, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:17:182&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 17.182&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,008:884&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Supp.&lt;/title&gt; 884&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρὸν τὰν πόλιν ποιεῖς&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0521,001:169&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Epich.&lt;/author&gt; 169&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρῷ&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;in the country,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:11:188&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 11.188&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐπʼ ἀγροῦ&lt;/foreign&gt; in &lt;i&gt;the country,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:1:190&quot;&gt;1.190&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:22:47&quot;&gt;22.47&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐπʼ ἀγρὸῦ νόσφι πόληος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:1:185&quot;&gt;1.185&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; in pl., &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;κατὰ πτόλιν ἠὲ κατʼ ἀγρούς&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:17:18&quot;&gt;17.18&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐν οἴκοις ἢ ʼν ἀγροῖς&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,004:112&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;OT&lt;/title&gt; 112&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐπʼ ἀγρῶν&lt;/foreign&gt; ib. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,004:1049&quot;&gt;1049&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγροῖσι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,005:313&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;El.&lt;/title&gt; 313&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τὸν ἐξ ἀγρῶν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,004:1051&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;OT&lt;/title&gt; 1051&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τὰ ἐξ ἀγρῶν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:2:13&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 2.13&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:2:14&quot;&gt;14&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;κατʼ ἀγρούς&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0434,001:318&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Cratin.&lt;/author&gt; 318&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,034:881c&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lg.&lt;/title&gt; 881c&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οἰκεῖν ἐν ἀγρῷ&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,012:387:2&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 387.2&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τὰ ἐν ἀγρῷ γιγνόμενα&lt;/foreign&gt;  &lt;i&gt;fruits,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,002:2:9:4&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Mem.&lt;/title&gt; 2.9.4&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,006:5:3:9&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;An.&lt;/title&gt; 5.3.9&lt;/bibl&gt;:—prov., &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οὐδὲν ἐξ ἀγροῦ λέγεις, ἀγροῦ πλέως,&lt;/foreign&gt; i.e. boorish, &lt;author&gt;Suid.&lt;/author&gt;, &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;—Rare in later Greek, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0031,002:15:21&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Ev.Marc.&lt;/title&gt; 15.21&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Amh.:2:134:5&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;PAmh.&lt;/title&gt; 2.134.5&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Oxy.:967&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;POxy.&lt;/title&gt; 967&lt;/bibl&gt;. [&lt;pron extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ᾰ&lt;/pron&gt; by nature, so always in Com., exc. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,006:579&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Av.&lt;/title&gt; 579&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0487,001:116&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Philem.&lt;/author&gt; 116&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ᾱγρόθεν&lt;/itype&gt; in &lt;author&gt;Alc.Com.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0383,001:19&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;19&lt;/bibl&gt; is paratrag.] (Cf. Skt. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;sa&quot;&gt;ájras&lt;/foreign&gt; ‘plain’, prob. fr. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;sa&quot;&gt;aj&lt;/foreign&gt; ‘drive’ (cf. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγω&lt;/foreign&gt;), &lt;abbr&gt;i.e.&lt;/abbr&gt; &lt;i&gt;pasture.&lt;/i&gt;) &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n942\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n942\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"954\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγροτέκτων\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino: equivalente a ἔποψ, nome de ave, poupa; testemunho atribuído a Alexandre de Licópolis.\">ἀγροτέκτων</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino: equivalente a ἔποψ, nome de ave, poupa; testemunho atribuído a Alexandre de Licópolis.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)grote/ktwn&quot; orig_id=&quot;n942&quot; key=&quot;a)grote/ktwn&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγροτέκτων&quot;&gt;ἀγροτέκτων&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n942.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= ἔποψ, &lt;author&gt;Al.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Le.&lt;/title&gt; 11.19.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n943\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n943\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"955\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρότερος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo poético -α, -ον. I. Selvagem, do campo, especialmente de animais e plantas, Homero, Hesíodo. II. Campônio, de gente rural. III. Relativo\">ἀγρότερος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo poético -α, -ον. I. Selvagem, do campo, especialmente de animais e plantas, Homero, Hesíodo. II. Campônio, de gente rural. III. Relativo à caça, que gosta de caçar, de ninfa. IV. Ἀγροτέρα, epíteto de Ártemis caçadora, cultuada em Agra, Ática e Esparta.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gro/teros&quot; orig_id=&quot;n943&quot; key=&quot;a)gro/teros&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρό-τερος&quot;&gt;ἀγρότερος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;α&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, (&lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρός&lt;/foreign&gt;; properly opp. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὀρέσ-τερος&lt;/foreign&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n943.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;poet. for &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγριος,&lt;/foreign&gt; in &lt;author&gt;Hom.&lt;/author&gt; always of &lt;i&gt;wild&lt;/i&gt; animals, &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἡμίονοι, σύες, αἶγες,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:2:852&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 2.852&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:12:146&quot;&gt;12.146&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:17:295&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 17.295&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγροτέρης ἐλάφοιο&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0020,003:407&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hes.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Sc.&lt;/title&gt; 407&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;φὴρ ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,002:3:4&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;P.&lt;/title&gt; 3.4&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;: abs., &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρότεροι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0005,001:8:58&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Theoc.&lt;/author&gt; 8.58&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. καὶ νέποδες&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:6:11&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 6.11&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Satyr.&lt;/author&gt;). &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n943.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; of &lt;i&gt;countrymen,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:9:244&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 9.244&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Apollonid.&lt;/author&gt;), &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:16:235&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;APl.&lt;/title&gt; 16.235&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt;). &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;3&quot; id=&quot;n943.2&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; of plants, &lt;i&gt;wild,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:9:384&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 9.384.8&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0022,001:711&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Nic.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Th.&lt;/title&gt; 711&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,4081,001:111&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Coluth.&lt;/author&gt; 111&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n943.3&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἄγρα&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;i&gt;fond of the chase, huntress,&lt;/i&gt; of the nymph Cyrene, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,002:9:6&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;P.&lt;/title&gt; 9.6&lt;/bibl&gt;: metaph., &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;μέριμνα ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,001:2:60&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;O.&lt;/title&gt; 2.60&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n943.4&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; pr. n. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Ἀγροτέρα,&lt;/foreign&gt; Artemis &lt;i&gt;the huntress,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:21:471&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 21.471&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,014:6:13&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cyn.&lt;/title&gt; 6.13&lt;/bibl&gt;; worshipped at Agra in Attica, &lt;title&gt;IG&lt;/title&gt; 2.467, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0525,001:1:19:6&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Paus.&lt;/author&gt; 1.19.6&lt;/bibl&gt;; at Sparta and elsewhere, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,001:4:2:20&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;HG&lt;/title&gt; 4.2.20&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,002:660&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Eq.&lt;/title&gt; 660&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n944\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n944\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"956\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγροτήρ\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino, genitivo -ῆρος: camponês, equivalente a ἀγρότης; feminino adjetival ἀγρότειρα, rústica; Eurípides.\">ἀγροτήρ</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino, genitivo -ῆρος: camponês, equivalente a ἀγρότης; feminino adjetival ἀγρότειρα, rústica; Eurípides.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)groth/r&quot; orig_id=&quot;n944&quot; key=&quot;a)groth/r&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρο-τήρ&quot;&gt;ἀγροτήρ&lt;/head&gt; &lt;pron extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;[ᾰ]&lt;/pron&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ῆρος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n944.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= ἀγρότης, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,012:463&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;El.&lt;/title&gt; 463&lt;/bibl&gt; (lyr.):—fem. &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀγρότειρα&lt;/orth&gt;, as &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adj.&lt;/pos&gt;, &lt;i&gt;rustic,&lt;/i&gt; ib. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,012:168&quot;&gt;168&lt;/bibl&gt; (lyr.).&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n945\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n945\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"957\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρότης\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino poético. I. Camponês, habitante dos campos; Eurípides. II. Caçador, de pessoas, ninfas, Pã e Ártemis; feminino ἀγρότις; Hom\">ἀγρότης</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino poético. I. Camponês, habitante dos campos; Eurípides. II. Caçador, de pessoas, ninfas, Pã e Ártemis; feminino ἀγρότις; Homero, Álcman, Antologia Palatina.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gro/ths&quot; orig_id=&quot;n945&quot; key=&quot;a)gro/ths&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρό-της&quot;&gt;ἀγρότης&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ου&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀγρός&lt;/etym&gt;) poet. word, &lt;sense id=&quot;n945.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;countryman, rustic,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. ἀνήρ&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,016:1270&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Or.&lt;/title&gt; 1270&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;title&gt;App.Anth.&lt;/title&gt; 4.20; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πάροινος ἀ.&lt;/foreign&gt; ib. 5.57. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n945.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἄγρα&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;i&gt;hunter,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οἰωνοί . . οἷσί τε τέκνα ἀγρόται ἐξείλοντο&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:16:218&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 16.218&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0291,001:23:8&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Alcm.&lt;/author&gt; 23.8&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρότα Πάν,&lt;/foreign&gt; to whom &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;δίκτυα ἀπʼ ἀγρεσίης&lt;/foreign&gt; are offered, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:6:13&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 6.13&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Leon.&lt;/author&gt;):—fem. &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀγρότις&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;νύμφη&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0001,001:2:509&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.R.&lt;/author&gt; 2.509&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. κούρα,&lt;/foreign&gt; i.e. Artemis, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:6:111&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 6.111&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Antip.&lt;/author&gt;); &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. αἰγανέη&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:6:57&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;ib. 57&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Paul.Sil.&lt;/author&gt;). &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;III&quot; id=&quot;n945.2&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; for &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,002:1002&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pers.&lt;/title&gt; 1002&lt;/bibl&gt; v. ἀγρέτης.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n946\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n946\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"958\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγροῦαι\" data-meanings=\"Glosa plural ἀγροῦαι = ἀγροῖκοι, «camponeses, rústicos»; Hesíquio.\">ἀγροῦαι</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Glosa plural ἀγροῦαι = ἀγροῖκοι, «camponeses, rústicos»; Hesíquio.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)grou=ai&quot; orig_id=&quot;n946&quot; key=&quot;a)grou=ai&quot; type=&quot;gloss&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγροῦαι·&quot;&gt;ἀγροῦαι&lt;/head&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγροῖκοι,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n947\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n947\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"959\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγροφον\" data-meanings=\"Glosa ἄγροφον = ὀρεινόν, «montanhês, das montanhas»; Hipócrates em Galeno e Suda.\">ἄγροφον</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Glosa ἄγροφον = ὀρεινόν, «montanhês, das montanhas»; Hipócrates em Galeno e Suda.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/grofon&quot; orig_id=&quot;n947&quot; key=&quot;a)/grofon&quot; type=&quot;gloss&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγροφον·&quot;&gt;ἄγροφον&lt;/head&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὀρεινόν,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; ap. &lt;author&gt;Gal.&lt;/author&gt; 19.69, &lt;author&gt;Suid.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n948\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n948\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"960\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγροφύλαξ\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino: guarda rural, vigilante ou guardião do território campestre; epigramas e papiros.\">ἀγροφύλαξ</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino: guarda rural, vigilante ou guardião do território campestre; epigramas e papiros.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)grofu/lac&quot; orig_id=&quot;n948&quot; key=&quot;a)grofu/lac&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγροφύλαξ&quot;&gt;ἀγροφύλαξ&lt;/head&gt; &lt;pron extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;[ῠ]&lt;/pron&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n948.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;guardian of the country,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:16:243&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;APl.&lt;/title&gt; 16.243&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Antist.&lt;/author&gt;), &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Rein.:48&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;PRein.&lt;/title&gt; 48&lt;/bibl&gt; &lt;date&gt;(ii A.D.)&lt;/date&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Lond.:403:11&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;PLond.&lt;/title&gt; 403.11&lt;/bibl&gt; &lt;date&gt;(iv A.D.)&lt;/date&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n949\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n949\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"961\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγρυκτος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον, de ἀ- privativo e γρύζω: indizível, de que não se deve falar, de acontecimentos; Ferécrates 157.\">ἄγρυκτος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον, de ἀ- privativo e γρύζω: indizível, de que não se deve falar, de acontecimentos; Ferécrates 157.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/gruktos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n949&quot; key=&quot;a)/gruktos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγρυκτος&quot;&gt;ἄγρυκτος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ-&lt;/etym&gt; priv., &lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;γρύζω&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n949.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;not to be spoken of,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγρυκτα παθεῖν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0486,001:157&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pherecr.&lt;/author&gt; 157&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n949a\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n949a\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"962\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρυξία\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino: silêncio profundo, silêncio absoluto; Píndaro, fragmento 229. Suplemento LSJ.\">ἀγρυξία</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino: silêncio profundo, silêncio absoluto; Píndaro, fragmento 229. Suplemento LSJ.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gruci/a&quot; orig_id=&quot;n949a&quot; key=&quot;a)gruci/a&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρυξία&quot;&gt;ἀγρυξία&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n949a.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;dead silence,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,005:229&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 229&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n950\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n950\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"963\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρυπνέω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo. I. Permanecer acordado, passar a noite sem dormir, sofrer de insônia; Teógnis, Hipócrates, Platão. II. Figuradamente velar, vigiar, ficar \">ἀγρυπνέω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo. I. Permanecer acordado, passar a noite sem dormir, sofrer de insônia; Teógnis, Hipócrates, Platão. II. Figuradamente velar, vigiar, ficar alerta, inclusive sobre almas; Sabedoria 6.15, Marcos 13.33, Efésios 6.18, Hebreus 13.17. III. Com acusativo, permanecer desperto pensando em alguém; papiro mágico parisiense.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)grupne/w&quot; orig_id=&quot;n950&quot; key=&quot;a)grupne/w&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρυπν-έω&quot;&gt;ἀγρυπνέω&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;pf.&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἠγρύπνηκα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,003:2&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Prog.&lt;/title&gt; 2&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;:—&lt;sense id=&quot;n950.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;lie awake, pass sleepless nights,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0002,001:471&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Thgn.&lt;/author&gt; 471&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; l.c., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,034:695a&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lg.&lt;/title&gt; 695a&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.; opp. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;καθεύδω,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,007:8:3:42&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cyr.&lt;/title&gt; 8.3.42&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρυπνεῖν τὴν νύκτα&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;to pass a sleepless&lt;/i&gt; night, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,001:7:2:19&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;HG&lt;/title&gt; 7.2.19&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0541,001:113&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Men.&lt;/author&gt; 113&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οἱ -οῦντες&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;sufferers from insomnia,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Dsc.&lt;/author&gt; 4.64. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n950.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; metaph., &lt;i&gt;to be watchful,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0527,035:6:15&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;LXX&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Wi.&lt;/title&gt; 6.15&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0031,002:13:33&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Ev.Marc.&lt;/title&gt; 13.33&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0031,010:6:18&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Ep.Eph.&lt;/title&gt; 6.18&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὑπὲρ τῶν ψυχῶν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0031,019:13:17&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Ep.Hebr.&lt;/title&gt; 13.17&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐπὶ τὰ κακά&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0527,056:9:14&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;LXX&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Da.&lt;/title&gt; 9.14&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;: c. &lt;mood opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;inf.&lt;/mood&gt;, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;μηθέν σε ἐνοχλήσειν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Grenf.:2:14a:3&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;PGrenf.&lt;/title&gt; 2.14a3&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;3&quot; id=&quot;n950.2&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; c. acc., &lt;i&gt;lie awake and think of,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τινά&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;title&gt;PMag.Par.&lt;/title&gt; 1.2966&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n951\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n951\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"964\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρυπνητέον\" data-meanings=\"Verbal impessoal: deve-se velar ou manter vigilância; Eustácio 168.16.\">ἀγρυπνητέον</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbal impessoal: deve-se velar ou manter vigilância; Eustácio 168.16.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)grupnhte/on&quot; orig_id=&quot;n951&quot; key=&quot;a)grupnhte/on&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρυπν-ητέον&quot;&gt;ἀγρυπνητέον&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n951.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;one must watch,&lt;/i&gt; Eust 168.16.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n952\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n952\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"965\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρυπνητήρ\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino, genitivo -ῆρος: aquele que vigia, vigia noturno; Manílio 1.81.\">ἀγρυπνητήρ</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino, genitivo -ῆρος: aquele que vigia, vigia noturno; Manílio 1.81.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)grupnhth/r&quot; orig_id=&quot;n952&quot; key=&quot;a)grupnhth/r&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρυπν-ητήρ&quot;&gt;ἀγρυπνητήρ&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ῆρος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n952.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;watcher,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2583,001:1:81&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Man.&lt;/author&gt; 1.81&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n953\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n953\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"966\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρυπνητής\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino: vigia, guardião (latim excubitor); glossário.\">ἀγρυπνητής</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino: vigia, guardião (latim excubitor); glossário.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)grupnhth/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n953&quot; key=&quot;a)grupnhth/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρυπν-ητής&quot;&gt;ἀγρυπνητής&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n953.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;foreign lang=&quot;lat&quot;&gt;excubitor,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;title&gt;Gloss.&lt;/title&gt;&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n954\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n954\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"967\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρυπνητικός\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ή, -όν. I. Vigilante, propenso a permanecer acordado; Diodoro, Plutarco. II. Que provoca insônia ou mantém desperto; Galeno, papiros má\">ἀγρυπνητικός</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ή, -όν. I. Vigilante, propenso a permanecer acordado; Diodoro, Plutarco. II. Que provoca insônia ou mantém desperto; Galeno, papiros mágicos. Neutro ἀγρυπνητικόν: feitiço ou encantamento para produzir vigília.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)grupnhtiko/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n954&quot; key=&quot;a)grupnhtiko/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρυπν-ητικός&quot;&gt;ἀγρυπνητικός&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ή&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;όν&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n954.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;wakeful,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0060,001:33:21&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.S.&lt;/author&gt; 33.21&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,011:27&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cam.&lt;/title&gt; 27&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n954.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;producing wakefulness,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;PLond.&lt;/title&gt; 1.96, &lt;title&gt;PMag.Par.&lt;/title&gt; 1.2943, &lt;author&gt;Gal.&lt;/author&gt; 10.930 :—&lt;orth extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀγρυπν-ητικόν&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;τό&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;i&gt;spell for this purpose,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;PMag.Lond.&lt;/title&gt; 121.374, &lt;title&gt;PMag.Leid.&lt;/title&gt; V.11.26.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n955\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n955\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"968\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρυπνία\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino, jônico -ίη. I. Insônia, ausência de sono ou estado de vigília; Hipócrates, Heródoto, Platão. II. Tempo passado vigiando, tu\">ἀγρυπνία</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino, jônico -ίη. I. Insônia, ausência de sono ou estado de vigília; Hipócrates, Heródoto, Platão. II. Tempo passado vigiando, turno de vigília; Justiniano. III. Figuradamente, poema produzido por noites de trabalho sem dormir, Calímaco.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)grupni/a&quot; orig_id=&quot;n955&quot; key=&quot;a)grupni/a&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρυπν-ία&quot;&gt;ἀγρυπνία&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Ion.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-ιη,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n955.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;sleeplessness, wakefulness,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,012:2:3&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Aph.&lt;/title&gt; 2.3&lt;/bibl&gt;, al., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,003:43b&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cri.&lt;/title&gt; 43b&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.; in pl., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,004:42&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Acut.&lt;/title&gt; 42&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρυπνίῃσιν εἴχετο&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:3:129&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 3.129&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;title&gt;IG&lt;/title&gt; 4.952.50 (Epid.), &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,007:27&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lys.&lt;/title&gt; 27&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,030:460d&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;R.&lt;/title&gt; 460d&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n955.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;time of watching,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,038:368b&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ax.&lt;/title&gt; 368b&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οἱ τῆς ἀ. ἄρχοντες&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2734,013:13&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Just.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Nov.&lt;/title&gt; 13&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;&lt;title&gt;Pr.&lt;/title&gt; &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;III&quot; id=&quot;n955.2&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; of poetry, &lt;i&gt;product of sleepless nights,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0533,003:27:4&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Call.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Epigr.&lt;/title&gt; 27.4 Pf.&lt;/bibl&gt; [&lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ι-&lt;/itype&gt; in &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0024,001:3:511&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Opp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;C.&lt;/title&gt; 3.511&lt;/bibl&gt;.]&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n956\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n956\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"969\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγρυπνος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον. I. Desperto, vigilante, que não dorme, de pessoas e metaforicamente de raio de Zeus ou litoral; τὸ ἄγρυπνον, vigilância. II. Ativo:\">ἄγρυπνος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον. I. Desperto, vigilante, que não dorme, de pessoas e metaforicamente de raio de Zeus ou litoral; τὸ ἄγρυπνον, vigilância. II. Ativo: que espanta o sono, que impede dormir, de pensamentos e preocupações. Advérbio ἀγρύπνως.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/grupnos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n956&quot; key=&quot;a)/grupnos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγρυπν-ος&quot;&gt;ἄγρυπνος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n956.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;wakeful,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,006:1:3:18&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Epid.&lt;/title&gt; 1.[3.]18&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,030:404a&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;R.&lt;/title&gt; 404a&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,035:1314b:35&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pol.&lt;/title&gt; 1314b35&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.: metaph., &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Ζηνὸς ἄ. βέλος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,003:360&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pr.&lt;/title&gt; 360&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἠιόνες&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:7:278&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 7.278&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Arch.&lt;/author&gt;):—&lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τὸ ἄ.&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;vigilance,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,002:24&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Aër.&lt;/title&gt; 24&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,089:355:b&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Isid.&lt;/title&gt; 2.355b&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-νως&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;title&gt;OGI&lt;/title&gt; 194.23&lt;/cit&gt; (&lt;placeName&gt;Egypt&lt;/placeName&gt;, &lt;date&gt;i B.C.&lt;/date&gt;). &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n956.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Act.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, &lt;i&gt;banishing sleep, keeping awake,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;νοήσεις&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,036:917b:1&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pr.&lt;/title&gt; 917b1&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;μέριμναι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:16:211&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;APl.&lt;/title&gt; 16.211&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; (Stat. Flacc.). [&lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ᾰγρῠπνος&lt;/itype&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,052:2&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Rh.&lt;/title&gt; 2&lt;/bibl&gt; (lyr.), &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ᾱγρῠπνος&lt;/itype&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0005,001:24:106&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Theoc.&lt;/author&gt; 24.106&lt;/bibl&gt;.]&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n957\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n957\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"970\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρυπνώδης\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ες: que causa insônia, que impede o sono; leitura variante em Hipócrates, Prorrético 1.10.\">ἀγρυπνώδης</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ες: que causa insônia, que impede o sono; leitura variante em Hipócrates, Prorrético 1.10.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)grupnw/dhs&quot; orig_id=&quot;n957&quot; key=&quot;a)grupnw/dhs&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρυπν-ώδης&quot;&gt;ἀγρυπνώδης&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ες&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n957.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;making sleepless,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,016:1:10&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Prorrh.&lt;/title&gt; 1.10&lt;/bibl&gt; as &lt;abbr&gt;v.l.&lt;/abbr&gt;&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n958\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n958\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"971\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγρωμα\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo neutro, significado incerto: possivelmente direito de caça; inscrição de Gortina, Annuario 3.195.\">ἄγρωμα</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo neutro, significado incerto: possivelmente direito de caça; inscrição de Gortina, Annuario 3.195.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/grwma&quot; orig_id=&quot;n958&quot; key=&quot;a)/grwma&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγρωμα&quot;&gt;ἄγρωμα&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;τό&lt;/gen&gt;, perh. = &lt;sense id=&quot;n958.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;right of hunting,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;Annuario&lt;/title&gt; 3.195 (&lt;placeName&gt;Gortyn&lt;/placeName&gt;).&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n959\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n959\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"972\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγρωσσα\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino: caçadora, epíteto de uma cadela; Simônides 130.\">ἄγρωσσα</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino: caçadora, epíteto de uma cadela; Simônides 130.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/grwssa&quot; orig_id=&quot;n959&quot; key=&quot;a)/grwssa&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγρωσσα&quot;&gt;ἄγρωσσα&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n959.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;huntress,&lt;/i&gt; epith. of a hound, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0261,001:130&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Simon.&lt;/author&gt; 130&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n960\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n960\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"973\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρώσσω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo épico, equivalente a ἀγρεύω: capturar, apanhar, pescar; figuradamente sair à caça. Empregado sobretudo no presente; passivo em Opiano.\">ἀγρώσσω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo épico, equivalente a ἀγρεύω: capturar, apanhar, pescar; figuradamente sair à caça. Empregado sobretudo no presente; passivo em Opiano.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)grw/ssw&quot; orig_id=&quot;n960&quot; key=&quot;a)grw/ssw&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρώσσω&quot;&gt;ἀγρώσσω&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Ep.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; for &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρεύω,&lt;/foreign&gt; only in &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;pres.&lt;/tns&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n960.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;catch,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρώσσων ἰχθῦς&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:5:53&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 5.53&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; freq. in &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0023,001:3:339&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Opp.&lt;/author&gt;, &lt;title&gt;H.&lt;/title&gt; 3.339&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0023,001:543&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;543&lt;/bibl&gt;, al., cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0533,016:60&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Call.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ap.&lt;/title&gt; 60&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0341,002:598&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Lyc.&lt;/author&gt; 598&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.: abs., &lt;i&gt;go hunting,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0024,001:1:129&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Opp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;C.&lt;/title&gt; 1.129&lt;/bibl&gt;:—&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Pass.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0023,001:3:415&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;H.&lt;/title&gt; 3.415&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0023,001:4:565&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;4.565&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n961\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n961\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"974\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρώστης\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino. I. Camponês, do campo, como substantivo e adjetivo, tragédia e epigrama. II. Selvagem, de ave. III. Caçador, Apolônio de R\">ἀγρώστης</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino. I. Camponês, do campo, como substantivo e adjetivo, tragédia e epigrama. II. Selvagem, de ave. III. Caçador, Apolônio de Rodes. IV. Nome de espécie de aranha; Nicandro.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)grw/sths&quot; orig_id=&quot;n961&quot; key=&quot;a)grw/sths&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρ-ώστης&quot;&gt;ἀγρώστης&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ου&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n961.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= ἀγρότης, &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Subst.&lt;/pos&gt; and &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adj.&lt;/pos&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,008:94&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 94&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,009:377&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;HF&lt;/title&gt; 377&lt;/bibl&gt; (lyr.), &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,052:287&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Rh.&lt;/title&gt; 287&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:6:37&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 6.37&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0533,009:260:13&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Call.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Hec.&lt;/title&gt; 1.1.13&lt;/bibl&gt; [Fr. 260.13 Pf.], &lt;abbr&gt;v.l.&lt;/abbr&gt; in &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0005,001:25:48&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Theoc.&lt;/author&gt; 25.48&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n961.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;wild,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;κήυκες&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0614,001:115:2&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Babr.&lt;/author&gt; 115.2&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n961.2&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;hunter,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0001,001:4:175&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.R.&lt;/author&gt; 4.175&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n961.3&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; a kind of &lt;i&gt;spider,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0022,001:734&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Nic.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Th.&lt;/title&gt; 734&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n962\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n962\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"975\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρωστῖνος\" data-meanings=\"Forma siracusana correspondente a ἄγροικος, título de peça de Epicarmo; plural ἀγρωστῖναι glosado como ninfas montanhesas em Hesíquio.\">ἀγρωστῖνος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Forma siracusana correspondente a ἄγροικος, título de peça de Epicarmo; plural ἀγρωστῖναι glosado como ninfas montanhesas em Hesíquio.</p></section><details><summary>Texto original TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)grwsti=nos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n962&quot; key=&quot;a)grwsti=nos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρ-ωστῖνος&quot;&gt;ἀγρωστῖνος&lt;/head&gt;, Syrac. for &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγροικος,&lt;/foreign&gt; name of play by &lt;author&gt;Epich.&lt;/author&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρωστῖναι· νύμφαι ὄρειοι,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>";
